\doTocEntry\toclof{}{\csname a:TocLink\endcsname{14}{x14-166003}{}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces A convex combination of the points $\x $ and $\y $ is given by $\z = \lambda \x + (1-\lambda )\y $ with any $\lambda \in [0,1]$. Here we demonstrate this using $\lambda = 2/3$. \relax }}}{304}\relax 
